1
00:00:00,627 --> 00:00:02,957
(Sheldon:)I'd love to have you
join us on a double date.

2
00:00:02,962 --> 00:00:04,532
(Amy:)Aw...

3
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:08,501
(Amy:)You are aware that a double date
doesn't count as two dates.

4
00:00:09,636 --> 00:00:11,766
(Leonard:)Oh.

5
00:00:11,771 --> 00:00:12,771
(Sheldon:)Well, then come
or don't.

6
00:00:12,772 --> 00:00:13,842
(Sheldon:)I don't care.

7
00:00:17,777 --> 00:00:20,707
(Bernadette:)I can't believe you're sore.

8
00:00:20,713 --> 00:00:23,953
(Howard:)Hey, even professional pitchers
need a rubdown after the game.

9
00:00:25,852 --> 00:00:27,552
(Bernadette:)But they throw
an actual ball.

10
00:00:27,554 --> 00:00:30,184
(Bernadette:)You were throwing
air at a TV.

11
00:00:31,691 --> 00:00:32,991
(Howard:)For your information,

12
00:00:32,992 --> 00:00:36,232
(Howard:)I also gave Leonard
one hell of a high five.

13
00:00:36,229 --> 00:00:38,459
(Bernadette:)I'm kind of surprised
you agreed to do this

14
00:00:38,464 --> 00:00:40,334
(Bernadette:)in front of a stadium
full of people.

15
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:42,663
(Howard:)They're doing Space Day
and NASA asked me.

16
00:00:42,669 --> 00:00:44,239
(Howard:)I felt like I couldn't say no.

17
00:00:44,237 --> 00:00:45,507
(Penny:)Okay.

18
00:00:45,505 --> 00:00:47,335
(Bernadette:)Well, if you want,
I could help you practice.

19
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,910
(Bernadette:)I played a lot of softball
growing up.

20
00:00:48,908 --> 00:00:51,238
(Howard:)Thank you, that
would be great.

21
00:00:51,244 --> 00:00:52,514
(Howard:)Great.
And while we're at it,

22
00:00:52,512 --> 00:00:53,712
(Bernadette:)maybe we could butch up your run

23
00:00:53,713 --> 00:00:55,143
(Bernadette:)for when you head out
to the mound.

24
00:00:56,749 --> 00:00:58,719
(Howard:)What's wrong with the way I run?

25
00:00:58,718 --> 00:00:59,748
Oh, just kidding.

